  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4584,
      "text": "Indeed, We have given you [O Prophet] a clear conquest[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4585,
      "text": "so that Allah may forgive you your previous and future sins[2], complete His favor upon you, and guide you to a straight path,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4586,
      "text": "and so that Allah may help you with a mighty victory.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4587,
      "text": "It is He Who sent down tranquility into the hearts of the believers so that they may increase in faith along with their faith. To Allah belong the soldiers of the heavens and earth. And Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4588,
      "text": "So that He may admit the believing men and women to gardens under which rivers flow, abiding therein forever, and absolve them of their sins; that is a supreme triumph before Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4589,
      "text": "And so that He may punish hypocrite men and women and polytheist men and women, who harbor about Allah evil thoughts[3]. An evil fate will befall them. Allah is angry with them and has cursed them and prepared for them Hell. What a terrible destination!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 511,
      "ruku": 446,
      "hizbQuarter": 204,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4590,
      "text": "To Allah belong the soldiers of the heavens and earth, and Allah is All-Mighty, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 48,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَتۡحِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fath",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Victory",
